<title>UK: Pendragon finance director Wheeler resigns.</title>
<headline>Pendragon finance director Wheeler resigns.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Pendragon Plc said on Friday its group finance director Ian Wheeler had resigned to take up a new job outside the group.</p>
<p>Wheeler would stay on until his successor was chosen, the company said.</p>
<p>Pendragon sells new and used vehicles and also deals in hire and post-sale service for cars in the UK.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
</text>
